WEBVTT

00:08.600 --> 00:09.760
Your humble servant

00:09.840 --> 00:11.507
Pays respects to Your Majesty

00:11.640 --> 00:13.973
Today, let's not follow the ruler-subject formalities

00:14.840 --> 00:16.000
I came to see you

00:16.080 --> 00:18.413
Just want to talk about family matters

00:19.880 --> 00:21.080
Yes

00:21.160 --> 00:22.560
Your Maj-

00:24.880 --> 00:26.040
Brother-in-law

00:26.120 --> 00:27.520
Come, sit

00:32.840 --> 00:34.240
I know

00:34.320 --> 00:35.560
These years

00:35.640 --> 00:37.080
You've been depressed

00:37.200 --> 00:38.600
Because of Ruolan

00:38.880 --> 00:40.120
I often think back

00:40.280 --> 00:41.480
To when Ruolan was still here

00:41.560 --> 00:42.480
Your Majesty

00:42.560 --> 00:43.800
If you have any matters

00:43.880 --> 00:46.200
Just directly order me to do them

